    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"JMP table at the start of the program. $0900 cold_start (the entry), $0903 $1c62, $0906 sample_pad, $0909 an RTS, $090c wait_jiffies, $090f hit_test, $0912 $1525, $0915 $18b8, $0918 $279e. The program uses only $0900 and $0906 (from read_cursor)."},
    {"at":6,"placement":"line","text":"JMP table entry: sample_pad. read_cursor calls it."},
    {"at":27,"placement":"line","text":"Cold start: stops the interrupts, sets the CIA 1 timer interrupt and the BRK and IRQ vectors, then runs the start-up script at $1e1a (through start_script)."},
    {"at":28,"placement":"side","text":"CIA 1 timer A latch = $4289"},
    {"at":33,"placement":"side","text":"CIA 1 timer A: start, continuous"},
    {"at":38,"placement":"side","text":"CIA 1: timer A interrupt on"},
    {"at":43,"placement":"side","text":"BRK vector = cold_start"},
    {"at":53,"placement":"side","text":"IRQ vector = irq_handler"}
